-- Spawns of the quest givers and turn-in NPCs of the Forever quests that our data did not have before (ids from the quest start/end of the Wowhead WoW Forever quest pages).
-- Position: x/y from the NPC's map points on its Wowhead Forever page (converted with the client UiMapAssignment); z from our navmesh: one floor there = that floor, several floors (building, cave) = the lowest, which was right for 71% of 1,306 such spots of the original world data; spots with several floors are in the GM-check list.
-- (+0.1). Points of one NPC within 0.8% of each other are one spawn. Cities and anything indoors are listed for a check in game: the terrain height is not the floor there.
-- guid block 46000000+ (ours).
DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 46000000 AND 46000999;
